{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xyxeYEgop81795135984.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市建局土瓜灣道項目，由信置及鷹君財團中標，作價遠低於市場預期。</p><p>財團以逾26.8億元出價，擊敗長實及中國海外，中標項目發展權，地盤位於土瓜灣道及榮光街，可建約1,080伙。</p><p>市建局發言人表示，幾間主要發展商均有參與投標，入標量與出價均在預期內，中標價也貼近市價。</p><p>信置主席黃永光就指，項目鄰近土瓜灣站，為優質九龍用地，也是集團一年內投得第5幅地皮，彰顯集團對香港長遠發展的承諾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:20.702396+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:15.138486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:26:42.269023+00:00","content_hash":"85b7baed1fab2b0a4eed5f4ff329b325f4cb3f746425d192249999fd55b7fe2d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:20.702396+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}